WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:07.110
SPEAKER: Give me
one minute, and I'll

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.960
show you how App Engine can help
you ship your next great app

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.310
idea.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.430
App Engine is a fully managed
serverless application platform

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.230
with simple administration.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.720
Write your code in any of
the supported languages,

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.120
or run custom containers with
the language and framework

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.290
of your choice.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.380
When your code is ready,
run gcloud app deploy.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.750
App Engine handles the
work of uploading your code

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.420
and running it on Google Cloud.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.189
It seamlessly scales from
zero to millions of requests

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:35.990
as your app becomes popular, and
you only pay for what you use.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.490
You can easily host different
versions of your app and split

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.220
traffic between them for A/B
testing and incremental feature

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.300
rollouts.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.305
You can debug and monitor
your app, even in production.

00:00:45.305 --> 00:00:46.680
And for the security
of your app,

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.740
App Engine offers free
managed SSL certificates

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.520
on your custom domain.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.620
App Engine works as a great
backend for mobile apps, APIs,

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.673
websites and more.

00:00:55.673 --> 00:00:57.090
So next time you've
got a cool app

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:00.570
you want to ship quickly, take
a minute to look at App Engine.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:04.550
To learn more, check out
cloud.goole.com/appengine.

